<P>
<B>Goal: Enable shape-based retrieval from an image database</B>
<UL>
<LI><B>input:</B> shape sketch
<LI><B>output:</B> images in database that most closely match input
shape
</UL>Question: How to measure similarity of shapes?
<BR>
Answer: Compare their <EM>skeletons</EM> (labeled graphs)
<BR>

